[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7143.39, "timestamp": "01:59:03", "text": "えーと、私は内心死にそうです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7145.189, "timestamp": "01:59:05", "text": "くしゃみ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7150.229, "timestamp": "01:59:10", "text": "ああ、そうだ、そうだ、そうだ。いいえ、くしゃみをしているんです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7153.27, "timestamp": "01:59:13", "text": "ああ、くしゃみが出てる。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7155.91, "timestamp": "01:59:15", "text": "それは何かの兆候だと思う。いや、問題は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7159.669, "timestamp": "01:59:19", "text": "机の上も全部掃除するけど、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7163.229, "timestamp": "01:59:23", "text": "ええ、時々もっと埃が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7165.75, "timestamp": "01:59:25", "text": "すごい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7169.91, "timestamp": "01:59:29", "text": "ええ、そう思います。うん。どうやって"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7173.99, "timestamp": "01:59:33", "text": "これも から来ないようにする"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7177.51, "timestamp": "01:59:37", "text": "reg が頻繁すぎますか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7187.27, "timestamp": "01:59:47", "text": "それは適切な換気が行われているということでしょうか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7189.669, "timestamp": "01:59:49", "text": "ああ、換気だ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7191.87, "timestamp": "01:59:51", "text": "しかし、それは難しい"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7194.27, "timestamp": "01:59:54", "text": "それ。だから、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7196.79, "timestamp": "01:59:56", "text": "人々が購入したいと思うような人。私はしません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7197.87, "timestamp": "01:59:57", "text": "知る。"}]